			"notes": "## What's New in 1.4\n- **Harvest Aura System Improvements**: Significantly improved scanning and harvesting efficiency in Harvest (Risky) mode.\n- **Crop Memory Queue**: Added intelligent memory for unplanted farm spots. In large farms, missing crops are remembered and automatically replanted as soon as seeds become available in your inventory.\n- **General Bugfixes & Stability Improvements**: Fixed keybind registration fallbacks and inventory slot sync issues.\n\n## Multi-Version Compatibility\nThis release contains compiled  assets for Minecraft versions **1.21.6 through 1.21.11**."
		},
